 to fill the vacancy, and any person so nominated shall be deemed to be a member of the Executive Committee of the Life Insurance Council or the General Insurance Council, as the case may be, as if he had been duly elected thereto. (4) Each of the said Executive Committees may make bye-laws for the transaction of any business at any meeting of the said Committee. (5) The Life Insurance Council or the General Insurance Council may form such other committees consisting of such persons as it may think fit to discharge such functions as may be delegated thereto. (6) The Secretary of the Executive Committee of the Life Insurance Council and of the Executive Committee of the General Insurance Council shall in each case be appointed by the Executive Committee concerned: Provided that each Secretary appointed by the Executive Committee concerned shall exercise all such powers and do all such acts as may be authorised in this behalf by the Executive Committee concerned.] 64G. Resignation and filling up of casual vacancies.—(1) Any member of the Executive Committee of	[0.05153735,-0.041452702,-0.012366689,0.0778651,0.012761648,0.020077765,-0.0045727612,0.004150941,0.05265159,0.05007812,0.016211618,0.003284365,0.025773695,-0.08012161,0.006573753,0.044988915,-0.03200716,0.023548672,0.0853405,0.0017159496,-0.024077263,-0.002281382,-0.015985591,-6.20614e-05,0.04265889,0.0338481,0.043691628,-0.027942915,-0.06249207,-0.019479336,0.038359318,-0.004861238,0.03377878,-0.053225495,-5.684002e-31,0.04186563,0.0035541488,-0.03837694,0.016934535,-0.019416124,-0.050293814,0.059072345,-0.05299197,-0.002121038,0.0061313333,0.08193833,0.022611422,0.03626327,0.005783876,0.08136481,-0.016581476,-0.021524893,-0.010174037,0.03317256,0.03423627,-0.001172532,-0.017281683,0.003276788,-0.0068335948,0.026381819,-0.005669351,-0.0025905857,-0.011352448,0.04391112,-0.011659058,0.009395262,-0.040969003,0.0010582848,0.051252358,-0.0048935036,0.031427186,-0.052925322,-0.0038147143,0.052679624,0.0021378093,0.